---
// Testimonials section
---

<section class="testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">REVIEWS</span>
    <h2>What Our Customers Say</h2>
    <p class="testimonials-sub">Real reviews from real fans. See why Cincinnati loves JTAPS.</p>
    
    <div class="testimonials-grid">
      <div class="testimonial-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">Best wings in Cincinnati, hands down. Pete's Sauce is absolutely legendary. Been coming here for years and they never disappoint.</p>
        <div class="testimonial-footer">
          <div class="author-avatar">M</div>
          <div>
            <p class="testimonial-author">Marcus T.</p>
            <p class="testimonial-source">Google Review</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">The perfect spot to watch the game with friends. 50+ TVs, amazing food, cold beer, and the vibe is unmatched. This is OUR sports bar.</p>
        <div class="testimonial-footer">
          <div class="author-avatar">J</div>
          <div>
            <p class="testimonial-author">Jennifer L.</p>
            <p class="testimonial-source">Google Review</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">Hand-carved gyros that taste like street food from Greece. The quality is incredible. Worth the trip to Glenway Ave every single time.</p>
        <div class="testimonial-footer">
          <div class="author-avatar">T</div>
          <div>
            <p class="testimonial-author">Tony D.</p>
            <p class="testimonial-source">Google Review</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">My go-to place for game day. The outdoor patio is gorgeous when the weather's nice, and the staff treats you like family. Highly recommend!</p>
        <div class="testimonial-footer">
          <div class="author-avatar">S</div>
          <div>
            <p class="testimonial-author">Sarah K.</p>
            <p class="testimonial-source">Google Review</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">Been a regular for 10+ years. The food, the atmosphere, the people—JTAPS is Cincinnati's best sports bar. Period. Don't sleep on this place.</p>
        <div class="testimonial-footer">
          <div class="author-avatar">R</div>
          <div>
            <p class="testimonial-author">Robert M.</p>
            <p class="testimonial-source">Google Review</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="testimonial-card reveal-on-scroll">
        <div class="quote-mark">"</div>
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="testimonial-text">Ordered food for a work event and it was incredible. The wings were gone in minutes. Definitely using them for our next team gathering!</p>
        <div class="testimonial-footer">
          <div class="author-avatar">A</div>
          <div>
            <p class="testimonial-author">Amanda C.</p>
            <p class="testimonial-source">Google Review</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="google-badge reveal-on-scroll">
      <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/JTAPS+Bar+and+Grill" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="google-link">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none"><path d="M44.5 20H24v8.5h11.8C34.7 33.9 30.1 37 24 37c-7.2 0-13-5.8-13-13s5.8-13 13-13c3.1 0 5.9 1.1 8.1 2.9l6.4-6.4C34.6 4.1 29.6 2 24 2 11.8 2 2 11.8 2 24s9.8 22 22 22c11 0 21-8 21-22 0-1.3-.2-2.7-.5-4z" fill="#4285F4"/><path d="M6.3 14.7l7 5.1C15 16 19.1 13 24 13c3.1 0 5.9 1.1 8.1 2.9l6.4-6.4C34.6 4.1 29.6 2 24 2 16.3 2 9.7 6.6 6.3 14.7z" fill="#EA4335"/><path d="M24 46c5.4 0 10.4-1.8 14.3-5.1l-6.9-5.7C29.5 37 27 38 24 38c-6 0-11.1-4-12.8-9.5l-7.1 5.4C7.5 41.2 15.2 46 24 46z" fill="#34A853"/><path d="M46 24c0-1.3-.2-2.7-.5-4H24v8.5h11.8c-1 2.7-2.8 4.9-5.2 6.4l6.9 5.7C42.1 36 46 30.6 46 24z" fill="#FBBC05"/></svg>
        <span>Read All 850+ Reviews on Google</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials {
    background: var(--bg-warm, #faf7f2);
    padding: 5rem 1rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .section-tag {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: var(--secondary-color);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .testimonials h2 {
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif);
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--primary-color);
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .testimonials-sub {
    text-align: center;
    color: #888;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .testimonials-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .testimonial-card {
    background: white;
    padding: 2rem 2rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    position: relative;
    border-left: 4px solid transparent;
  }

  .testimonial-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    border-left-color: var(--secondary-color);
  }

  .quote-mark {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 4rem;
    color: var(--secondary-color);
    opacity: 0.2;
    line-height: 1;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.75rem;
    right: 1.25rem;
  }

  .stars {
    color: #ffc107;
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .testimonial-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .testimonial-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .author-avatar {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--secondary-color);
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .testimonial-author {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary-color);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .testimonial-source {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #999;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .google-badge {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .google-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--primary-color);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border: 2px solid #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 999px;
    transition: border-color 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    background: white;
  }

  .google-link:hover {
    border-color: #4285F4;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(66, 133, 244, 0.15);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .testimonials h2 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }

    .testimonials-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .testimonial-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
